    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d708">

                <pb facs="0684" n="518" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg518"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Swenson </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 137</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1902-02-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 19, 1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to inform you that the Senate, by
                    its resolution of February 17, 1902, has given its advice and consent to the
                    ratification, without amendment, of the treaty signed by Mr. Constantin Brun,
                    the Danish Minister at Washington and myself on January 24th last, providing for
                    the cession to the United States of the islands of St. Thomas, St. John, and St.
                    Croix in the West Indies.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
